==Trivia==
* Although [[pyrefiend]]s, [[flaming pyrelord]]s, and [[pyrelord]]s all have an [[elemental weakness]] to [[water spells]], infernal pyrelords do not.
** Infernal pyrelords are also not immune to [[burn]] damage, unlike pyrefiends and pyrelords. It shares this trait with [[flaming pyrelord]]s.

